<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ASHA Privacy Policy</title>

    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.7/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.7.2/css/all.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

    <style>

        :root{
            --primary:#6D28D9;
            --secondary:#8B5CF6;
            --success:#10B981;
            --info:#06B6D4;
            --warning:#F59E0B;
            --light:#F8FAFC;
        }

        body{
            background:#F5F7FB;
            font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
            color:#374151;
        }

        .hero{
            background:linear-gradient(
                135deg,
                #6D28D9 0%,
                #8B5CF6 40%,
                #06B6D4 100%
            );
            color:white;
            padding:100px 0 130px;
            position:relative;
            overflow:hidden;
        }

        .hero::before{
            content:'';
            position:absolute;
            width:500px;
            height:500px;
            background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
            border-radius:50%;
            top:-200px;
            right:-150px;
        }

        .hero::after{
            content:'';
            position:absolute;
            width:350px;
            height:350px;
            background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
            border-radius:50%;
            bottom:-150px;
            left:-100px;
        }

        .glass-card{
            background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);
            backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
            border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.2);
            border-radius:20px;
            padding:25px;
        }

        .policy-card{
            background:white;
            border-radius:25px;
            padding:45px;
            margin-top:-70px;
            position:relative;
            z-index:100;
            box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.08);
        }

        .section{
            margin-bottom:35px;
        }

        .section-title{
            color:var(--primary);
            font-weight:700;
            margin-bottom:15px;
        }

        .icon-box{
            width:55px;
            height:55px;
            border-radius:15px;
            display:flex;
            align-items:center;
            justify-content:center;
            color:white;
            font-size:22px;
            margin-bottom:15px;
        }

        .purple{
            background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6D28D9,#8B5CF6);
        }

        .green{
            background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10B981,#34D399);
        }

        .blue{
            background:linear-gradient(135deg,#06B6D4,#38BDF8);
        }

        .orange{
            background:linear-gradient(135deg,#F59E0B,#FBBF24);
        }

        .info-card{
            background:white;
            border:none;
            border-radius:20px;
            padding:25px;
            height:100%;
            box-shadow:0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.06);
            transition:.3s;
        }

        .info-card:hover{
            transform:translateY(-5px);
        }

        .contact-box{
            background:linear-gradient(
                135deg,
                #EEF2FF,
                #E0F2FE
            );
            border-radius:20px;
            padding:25px;
        }

        .footer{
            background:#111827;
            color:white;
            text-align:center;
            padding:30px;
            margin-top:50px;
        }

        ul li{
            margin-bottom:10px;
        }

    </style>
</head>
<body>

<section class="hero">

    <div class="container">

        <div class="row align-items-center">

            <div class="col-lg-7">

                <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">
                    Privacy Policy
                </h1>

                <p class="lead">
                    ASHA – Digital Household &
                    Community Health Survey Platform
                </p>

                <p>
                    Protecting citizen data, empowering
                    healthcare workers, and ensuring
                    secure digital record management.
                </p>

            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-5">

                <div class="glass-card">

                    <h5>
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i>
                        Data Protection Commitment
                    </h5>

                    <hr>

                    <p class="mb-2">
                        ✔ Secure Data Collection
                    </p>

                    <p class="mb-2">
                        ✔ Authorized Access Only
                    </p>

                    <p class="mb-2">
                        ✔ Government Survey Support
                    </p>

                    <p class="mb-0">
                        ✔ Privacy Focused Design
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

<div class="container">

    <div class="policy-card">

        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold">
                Your Privacy Matters
            </h2>

            <p class="text-muted">
                Effective Date: June 2026
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="row g-4 mb-5">

            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="info-card text-center">
                    <div class="icon-box purple mx-auto">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5>Households</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted">
                        Family Registration &
                        Management
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="info-card text-center">
                    <div class="icon-box green mx-auto">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-heart-pulse"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5>Healthcare</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted">
                        Community Health Surveys
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="info-card text-center">
                    <div class="icon-box blue mx-auto">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5>Security</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted">
                        Protected User Data
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-3">
                <div class="info-card text-center">
                    <div class="icon-box orange mx-auto">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h5>Reporting</h5>
                    <p class="text-muted">
                        Program Monitoring
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">
                Information We Collect
            </h3>

            <p>
                ASHA may collect household and member
                information required for healthcare
                surveys and beneficiary management.
            </p>

            <ul>
                <li>House Number</li>
                <li>Member Name</li>
                <li>Gender & Age</li>
                <li>Date of Birth</li>
                <li>Marital Status</li>
                <li>Family Relationships</li>
                <li>Mobile Number</li>
                <li>Aadhaar Number</li>
                <li>ABHA ID</li>
                <li>Survey & Health Scheme Information</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">
                Why We Collect Data
            </h3>

            <ul>
                <li>Household Registration</li>
                <li>Community Health Surveys</li>
                <li>Beneficiary Identification</li>
                <li>Health Program Monitoring</li>
                <li>Service Delivery Planning</li>
                <li>Government Reporting Requirements</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">
                Data Security & Protection
            </h3>

            <p>
                We use industry-standard security measures
                to safeguard information from unauthorized
                access, disclosure, modification, or loss.
            </p>

            <div class="alert alert-success">
                <strong>Our Promise:</strong>
                ASHA never sells or commercially distributes
                personal information.
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">
                Data Sharing
            </h3>

            <p>
                Information may only be shared with
                authorized healthcare authorities,
                government departments, or where
                required by applicable law.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="section">
            <h3 class="section-title">
                User Rights
            </h3>

            <ul>
                <li>Request correction of inaccurate records</li>
                <li>Request data updates</li>
                <li>Request deletion where legally permitted</li>
                <li>Contact support regarding privacy concerns</li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-box">

            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-3">
                Contact Information
            </h4>

            <p>
                If you have any questions regarding this
                Privacy Policy or data handling practices,
                please contact us.
            </p>

            <p class="mb-1">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope"></i>
                ravikiranpyawalkar@gmail.com
            </p>

            
            <p class="mb-0">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-location-dot"></i>
                Maharashtra, India
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</div>

<footer class="footer">
    <h5>ASHA</h5>
    <p class="mb-0">
        Digital Household & Health Survey Platform
    </p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
